				<r3d:description language="eng">CAPE began as a collection of UK local governments&#039; Climate Action Plans, and has expanded to include a number of useful datapoints around climate, carbon emissions and local government.
The Climate Action Plan Explorer collects UK Council Climate Action Plans in a single database, alongside some data on area emissions estimates within the scope of influence of councils. It allows anyone to quickly and easily find out if their council has a plan, and put those plans into context.</r3d:description>
